# Superseded manual configuration format.
#
# ADR 0006 requires automatic discovery, live profiling, device selection, and
# heterogeneity-aware piped-ring window placement through potluck-server.
# Product users must not provide hosts, ranks, weights, bounds, RAM budgets, or
# VRAM budgets in a workers file.
#
# The workers-file capability and this example are removal targets. This file
# intentionally contains no usable configuration so it cannot be mistaken for
# a supported Potluck deployment.
